      "news_heading": "MecAi — The Smart School Assistant from Mays Daycare and Educational Centre",
      "news_category": "Education",
      "news_content": "Meet MecAi, the new AI assistant from Mays Daycare and Educational Centre — created to make learning easier, faster, and more fun! MecAi helps students with homework, answers school questions instantly, and explains lessons in simple ways anyone can understand. It’s like having a friendly teacher that’s always online — ready to help 24/7. At Mays, we believe technology should make education better. That’s why MecAi was built to support both teachers and students, turning learning into an exciting, interactive experience.💡 Smart. Helpful. Always Ready. That’s MecAi — your learning partner from Mays Daycare and Educational Centre. ",
